    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d59">

                <pb facs="0149" n="83" xml:id="pg83"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2131/263a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-12-26T16:00:00-05:00">December 26, 1934—4
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>72. Have you had an opportunity to obtain the reaction of the Colombian
                    Government with respect to the proposals transmitted with the Department’s
                    instruction No. 106 of December 10, 1934.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
